# Benchmarks

Performance benchmarks for {{.vars.name}}.

## Running Benchmarks

```bash
go test -bench=. -benchmem
```

## Expected Results

Results will vary by machine. Example output:

```
BenchmarkProcess-8           1000000    1234 ns/op    256 B/op    4 allocs/op
BenchmarkProcessParallel-8   5000000     234 ns/op     64 B/op    1 allocs/op
```
